          "title": "韩",
          "content": "<p>国在夜晚的首尔公园，启用“<a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/lifestyle-culture/article/3322654/south-korea-deploys-hologram-police-officer-fight-crime-and-its-working\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">全息警察</a>”。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025083011.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>你会看到一个真人大小的警察，站在公园草丛里，还会说话和做出动作。如果距离远，根本看不出是投影。</p>\n<p>警方说，该装置激活期间，公园的犯罪率下降了约22%。</p>",
