          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025083011.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一",
          "content": "<p>个美国程序员将一台老式咖啡机，改装成“<a href=\"https://www.dougmacdowell.com/coffeematic-pc.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">咖啡机电脑</a>”。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025080201.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这台电脑既可以当作电脑，也可以当作咖啡机，两者的所有功能都是可用的。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025080202.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这件事最难的地方是，咖啡机产生高温水蒸汽，而电脑不能进水，还需要散热。两者放在一起，电脑很难稳定运行。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025080203.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "咖啡机电脑",
              "url": "https://www.dougmacdowell.com/coffeematic-pc.html"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025080201.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025080202.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025080203.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Meta 公司",
          "content": "<p>发明了，可以控制电脑的腕带。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202507/bg2025072802.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这个腕带的大小就像一块手表，据说可以替代鼠标甚至触控笔，控制电脑。</p>\n<p>它的原理十分新颖，手指和手掌移动时，会产生肌肉的电信号，这个腕带能够读取这种电信号，并判断出动作的意图。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "Meta 公司",
              "url": "https://www.nytimes.com/2025/07/23/science/meta-computer-wristband-reardon.html"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202507/bg2025072802.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "矿井储能",
          "content": "<p>芬兰有一个1400米深的废弃矿井，一家英国公司计划将其变为储能电池。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202402/bg2024021102.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它的思路很简单，就是在矿井中安装悬挂重物的起重机。多余的电力用来将重物吊起，需要用电时，则让重物缓慢下落，释放重力势能，带动涡轮发电机发电。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202402/bg2024021103.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>如果这种方法可行，废弃矿井就能利用起来，转变为储能基地。</p>",
