          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202505/bg2025052102.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>轻量级服务器监控工具，带有 Web 界面，参考<a href=\"https://www.xda-developers.com/beszel-feature/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">介绍文章</a>。</p>",
